#: penelope_stationery/1 penelope_stationery/bulletin_sorter/4 penelope_stationery/penelope_sorter/4
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "OFFICE SUPPLIES"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You look like you need something."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And I've got plenty of things!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's actually Stella that needs something."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Is it that \"business\" thing?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's an opportunity!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You noticed I said that in quotes, right?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Right! An opportunity for her, not me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I mean I'll help regardless."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "She always looks so sad."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It's nice to see her trying something."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Anyway. I'm a supporter of all things that need support. Sign me up."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/PenelopeRecruit/0/g-1/48/b/1
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "For her. Not you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerry_quest/0/10
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerry_quest/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got these old thumbtacks for you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerry_quest/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "My little tackies! Come here you prickly lil' things."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerry_quest/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Give Jerry my best, would you?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerry_quest/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I know this is tough for him."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerrymission_penelopehatesplayer/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Penelope, just returning some missing thumbtacks."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerrymission_penelopehatesplayer/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerrymission_penelopehatesplayer/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope that was it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_jerrymission_penelopehatesplayer/0/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Goodbye then."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The frazzled figure standing before you has the sort of overworked and underpaid coworker energy you've not seen since you started working from home."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She startles when she sees you looking at her, dropping a number of office supplies clutched in her arms."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/22
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god... you can see me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/30
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You can see me!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/38
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god, you've walked by me for so long without looking at me... !"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/49
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Office Romance Magazine was right... maybe this really is my year!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Office Romance Magazine?'"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry... what?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, sorry... guess I didn't notice you before."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh yeah! It's the leading publication on office romances for office supplies!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Office Romance Magazine! The number one name in Office Supply Romantic Periodicals!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Office Romance Magazine said you'd say that too... it's all happening!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It said my love life was TOTALLY gonna be on fire this year!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And fires, as we all know, are a very good thing."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh gosh listen to me babbling at you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You don't even know my name!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't need to know it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably a good place to start."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go on then."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "What?! I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Yes, yes!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh, I'm gettin' to it! Uh..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm Penelope, and I'm your office supplies!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/14
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Which boy, let me tell ya—you sure haven't used those in a while!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... everything's online now..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno what you want me to say about that."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, but...!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Well jeeze, a sorry, or an \"I miss you\" might be nice!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It's great that you're here now though, cause now you can bear witness..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To what?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "TO THE RESURRECTION OF PENELOPE OFFICE SUPPLIES!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/14
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So what if no one's using me like they used to?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/22
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm not dead yet!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so right queen."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've got one foot in the grave."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're too cute to be single."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "YEAH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "NO!! NO NEGATIVITY ALLOWED!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "HELL YEAH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wait... what?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-13/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes a few seconds for your compliment to register with Penelope—a blush overtakes her face from chin to forehead, but she quickly shakes it off."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-3/c-13/31
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That was a real funny joke you just said! HAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Anyway your daily motivational office quotes calendar put it best."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Your most important work is always ahead of you, never behind you.\" - Stephen Stovey"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Now what do you think that means?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lead with your best asset—dat ass."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Time to look to a brighter tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I truly don't care."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "EXACTLY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh. Well... I guess that too... yeah, mmmhm."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-15/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But I'm pretty sure this is saying I've got an ass that won't quit."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-15/23
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And it's time I make sure everybody knows it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Well neither do I!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-4/c-16/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm not bothered at all!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Anyway to that end I've got a hot hot date with a crosstrainer."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/12
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You got any advice for me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just be yourself."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Match his energy at all times."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hmm... a little boring, but alright."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/21 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/21 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/21
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I HAVE ARRIVED TO DO BATTLE."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/38 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/38
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh there he is! I assume he means date."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/46 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/46
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "I MEANT JUST WHAT I SAID! PREPARE YOURSELF!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/57
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wow right! Love it!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-17/65
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "See you later!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Okay, cool cool cool cool, cool. I can do that."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/38
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Uh... I LOVE THAT! LET'S FUCKING FIGHT!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/49 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/73
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "TO ARMS!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/57
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "THIS IS GREAT! I'M NOT SCARED AT ALL!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-18/71 penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/98 penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You leave them to it..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Well jeeze, alright."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/57
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hey so like if I don't come back from this..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/65
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Tell everyone I died young and beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_intro/0/g-5/c-19/84
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "AAAGH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"The secret of getting ahead is getting started.\" - Marker Twain."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another 'Quote of the Day'?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow yeah totally."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That's your quote of the day calendar with the gems again!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You better believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I know right?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So the date with Kris was awful. A disaster even."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about it..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Skip to the point."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "He spent the night chasing me around with what looked like an axe but was probably just a spare ski or something."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "At the end of it he asked if he could see me again, but..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Instead of kissing me..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "He leaned in and whispered that I had the calves of a malnourished mountain goat."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/39
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And that he found my scrawniness appealing because of the potential I had..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/47
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "If I would just commit to FITNESS!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/55
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So anyway I'm thinking maybe masculinity is like, not my thing!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/63
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And that's okay!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I've got a date lined up with a real pretty shelf that's just as hot and strong as Kris..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And I'm like 90% sure she won't try to kill me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey that's great."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should date me instead."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I truly do not care about your love life."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Thanks! I think so too."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "WOW! You keep saying things like that I might just get the wrong idea!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Stop teasing me you big old kidder! HAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I don't either! I'm so above all this!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Look at us, two cool people who don't care about things!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But like, let's pretend for a moment we both care about my love life."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You got any tips for this date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Anything to keep in mind for going out with someone who could totally crush me with a pinkie..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But is also feminine and fine?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Masc or fem, just be yourself."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Feminine and fine? Sounds like you're describing yourself."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Try not to be the disaster you are."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Sure... okay... I can do that."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm gonna remember today's quote too."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together.\" — African Proverb"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Setting aside the whole problematic and most assuredly fake 'African Proverb' attribution..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/45
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Words of wisdom man! That calendar knows what's what!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "WOW! YEAH RIGHT!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You really gotta start watching what you say, you're gonna make me think the wrong things!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Try not to become a man of success but rather try to become a man of value.\" — Albert Finestein..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Okay... calm. Cool."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/48
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You got this Penelope."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/56
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Shout out to that motivational office quotes calendar man!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/64
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It always knows just what to say!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "HOW EXACTLY DOES ONE NOT BE A DISASTER?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "CAN YOU JUST NOT DO THAT?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "DO YOU JUST WAKE UP AND DECIDE TO BE SUCCESSFUL?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I WILL TRY HARDER!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/51
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Okay Penelope... calm down... remember your breathing..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/59
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"A successful man is the one who can lay a firm foundation with the bricks others have thrown at him.\" — David Drinkley"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/64
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Whew. Thanks again, Motivational Office Quote of the Day!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/72
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I don't know where I'd be without ya."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god, I think that's her now."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/14
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEY HEY HEY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/25/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A muscle-bound woman with the greatest set of abs you've ever seen bounds into the room, lifting Penelope up into the air and tossing her like a beach ball."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/26/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley bounds into the room, lifting Penelope up into the air and tossing her like a beach ball."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "AHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, I hope you're ready to get like totally swept off your feet!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "This is a real love connection and not two lonely things desperately clinging to each other in a last shot at love!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/56
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wow, that's just what I was about to say!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/64/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh! The human is here!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/64/b/9
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "We're in love too. Hope you're into that."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/65/b/1
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "We really are on the same page! But also like..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/68
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Please put me down..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/76
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh my god am I, am I messing up already!?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/84
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M SO SORRY! GOD STUPID STUPID SHELLEY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/92
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley drops Penelope like a ton of bricks."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/106
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Penelope slowly, painfully climbs to her feet while Shelley berates herself."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/114
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Grr! You always do this Shelley!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/122
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You get too excited and you just go in!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/130/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Even though your lover already taught you not to!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/133/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you could break from beating yourself up to go on your date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/134/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd be excited about dating Penelope too."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/135/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is none of my business."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hey, it's okay... why don't we just start over again, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/21 penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley turns towards Penelope, wiping away a few tears."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/29 penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/48
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Huh? Y-yeah... yeah."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god stop! Don't say that now..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I mean, thanks... but not in front of my date!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Come on Shelley, why don't we just get movin' huh?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Jeeze, alright."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Look, uh, Shelley..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You know, when I feel bad, I try to remember these words:"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"It's amazing how much you can accomplish when it doesn’t matter who gets the credit\". — Harry S. Shoeman"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley sniffles."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/53
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I don't... get it?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/61
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh, sure you do, honey. Now come on..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/69
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She takes Shelley's arm."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/77
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Let's go on that date!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_second_encounter/0/g-4/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you watch the two of them leave arm-in-arm you have a sinking feeling... you'll have to come back later and see how it went."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"We are what we repeatedly do. Excellence, therefore, is not an act but a habit.\" — Arispotle."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm back in the saddle and that's okay!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I take it your date with Shelley didn't go well."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Arispotle really knew his shit."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you ever come up with your own ideas?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh BOY didn't it!!!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "He did! He did!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That's why they paid him the big bucks to say that stuff."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That's besides the point."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-1/31 penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-2/45
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "My date with Shelley was AWFUL!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I do all the time!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But unlike you, <i>I</i> haven't abandoned office supplies!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm gonna use this amazing calendar!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/c-2/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "BUT ANYWAY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It was a complete disaster."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "She wouldn't stop crying at dinner."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "She kept talking about how I was her last chance at happiness..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/24/b/1
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Which seemed dramatic because she still is like totally all about you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And that if we didn't hold onto each other we'd both be old and alone."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She was right."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She couldn't be more wrong."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She had a babe like you on a date and cried the whole time?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Working hard is very important. You're not going to get anywhere without working extremely hard.\" — Forge Lucas!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "YOU'RE WRONG WRONG WRONG WRONG WRONG!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I just have to work harder at dating. And that's fine."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Yeah... YEAH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Dating is like a job interview, right?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I just need some more interviews!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"We are really competing against ourselves. We have no control over how other people perform.\" — Pete Cashmere."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/45
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I just gotta get back out there."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "She definitely cried the whole time..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I gave her all the motivational quotes I had but nothing worked."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Like, if <i>I</i> was crying and somebody said to me-"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/37
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"It’s not about money or connection — it’s the willingness to outwork and outlearn everyone.\" — Spark Cuban."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/45
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I definitely would have cheered up!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/56
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But I guess we can't all be me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So, Shelley... not the one."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But hey! I managed to get another date lined up on my way back here!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And it was like a totally real and spontaneous connection!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Not at all because he was like... around!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That would be a pretty bad reason to date someone."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If that's all it takes I'm around... and alive too."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know if I believe you..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It WOULD be, wouldn't it!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But that's not it at all! Not at ALL!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "HAHAHA! STOP IT, YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "THAT WAS A REALLY HILARIOUS JOKE YOU JUST TOLD! GAH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "AND I'M TOTALLY IN ON IT!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hey hey! I don't know if I like your tone!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"If you don’t create a great, rewarding place for people to work, they won’t do great work.\" — Ari Weinztwig"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm gonna need you to create a great and rewarding place for me to work, buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Turn that hateration into love and positivity!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Penelope looks past you to the desk—when you follow her gaze, you see a man wearing dice-chic standing nearby."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god... Chance! How long have you been standing there?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/22
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Ho there, fairest maiden!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/33
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Art thou ready for our date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you dating or LARPing?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You better treat her right."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is sad even for you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "DATING, OBVIOUSLY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/24
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "LARPing of course!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/35
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh... we're not going on a date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/43/b/1
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "I already have a little thing going on with the human..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "How else does one treat a maiden?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Never fear! She is in good hands."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Yeah! This is gonna be a good date."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "What's sad about this!? It's still a date!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "...this is a date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Do you... do you not want to date me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "No, no, I do! Oh my god oh my GOD!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/33/b/1
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Let's see... love-ending modifier with the human... and..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/36
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He rolls a small die, seemingly thrilled with the result."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/44
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Okay okay, it's definitely a date. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/52
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "There, see? A real date!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/60
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Not just me dating a guy out of pure convenience!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/68
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "This is gonna be the one, I can tell!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/79
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Oh yeah definitely—I rolled a 19 on my charisma check..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/87
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "This is gonna be truly excellent."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/95/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll... leave you to it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll see myself out?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-3/97/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Drop a smoke bomb and escape!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_third_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...help."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Perfection is not attainable, but if we choose perfection, we can catch excellence.\" — Vince Bombardi."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Let me tell ya... Chance? Not perfect."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Not even close."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/30
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But through chasing perfection, I have attained excellence with tonight's date."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was so bad about Chance?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you finally ready to give up and date me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Given your track record I find that hard to believe."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god... well... uuuhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You sound so SERIOUS when you say it!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Very funny you!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "HAHAHAHA! What a joke you just told!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Maybe if I was that funny my date would have gone better..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It's not my fault! I thought he was gonna be nice!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I thought we'd have so much to talk about..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So what if he's a nerd, so am I!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But he checked a stat sheet or rolled dice before he did EVERYTHING!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "He ordered breadsticks, pasta, and tiramisu because he had \"proficiency in Italian dining\"."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "When it was time to go he told me he wouldn't see me again..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Because he rolled a 7 and a 1-10 meant he couldn't see me again."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I GOT DUMPED BY FATE!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "THE UNIVERSE IS AGAINST ME!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You deserve someone brave enough to dump you himself."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't need a dice to dump you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You deserve better... you deserve me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Okay well... I'd rather not get dumped but I hear you, I hear you..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I understand what you're getting at."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...cause you wouldn't, right?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "RIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...yeah, you wouldn't."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I mean does anybody deserve you?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Maybe a movie star or a sexy billionaire!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Not a regular bunch of office supplies like me, though!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "HAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Okay enough about that!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Um, let me tell you about the absolute BABE I got a date with!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "She's so out of my league, honestly I'd think she was gonna say no."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But Office Romance Magazine says you can't hit a home run if you don't risk striking out!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And I hit a romantic home run for sure this time!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As if on cue, Skylar saunters into the office. Penelope lets out a girlish squeal."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/57
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "EEEE! THERE SHE IS! THE GLASSES OF MY DREAMS!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/71
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh, uh... hey... you!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh you're about to get dumped."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, you did great."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Skylar! Here for your date?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "NO! We're going to FALL IN LOVE!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh, yeah... about that..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Didn't I? You saw it here first."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "The beginning of our love story."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Uh... well..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar tucks a strand of hair behind her ear, unable to meet either of your gazes."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Um... I'm really proud of you for getting out there, Penelope."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "And you asked me out, and I did say yes."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "And I've been trying to get ready for our date but..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm sorry I..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I've never liked girls with glasses!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I wear glasses..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you are glasses..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow... close-minded."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7/b/1 penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/8/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "That's... different. I like you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/9/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I was able to overcome that with you!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/10/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...exactly."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's not the same thing, okay!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Do you like other humans?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... I'm trying?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. Objects only for me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't make any sense!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Ugh this is impossible. You'll never understand."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Exactly what a human would say."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...it is what it is!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "SORRY NOT SORRYYY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar flees from the two of you, leaving Penelope devastated in her wake."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Quick, get one of your dumb little quotes."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Penelope... I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would you like a hug?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...even motivational quotes can't help me now."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Guys don't make passes at girl who wear glasses\" -Some Jerk."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...anyway, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Awww... thank you... but even a warm hug can't save me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm going to the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And I'm gonna see how much cheese I can eat before I die of acute calcium poisoning."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Which is a very real and serious thing."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...see you later. Maybe."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"The employer generally gets the employees he deserves.\" — J. Paul Jetty"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I've been trying so hard to date."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I thought like... okay, maybe it's just a numbers game."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Gotta get some bad dates out of the way to have a good one."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And boy was I wrong."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But it's okay. I get it now."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/48
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "This is just how it is for someone like me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/56
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You get what you get and you'd better like it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that's true at all."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "NO! You deserve the best!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Yeah... yeah."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Maybe not for someone like you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But the facts are facts and for someone like me..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That's just facts."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Aw, you're sweet and all, but... I see now that I'm lucky anyone would put up with me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So I'm just gonna date whoever can stand me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "My date should be here any minute now, actually."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a strange chill in the air, a note of dread that raises goosebumps along your arms."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You feel Sinclaire before you see him—but he makes his presence known quickly enough."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/25
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "HERE COMES LOVING!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/39
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "CHOO CHOO - LOVE BUS COMES RATTLING INTO THE STATION."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/50/b/1
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "OH! HELLO OTHER LOVE OF MINE!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this really the best you think you can do?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you really gonna date this guy instead of me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow you two are perfect for each other."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Well... kinda, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It's not funny to say things like that, you know."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-1/4
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wait... no."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-1/12
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-1/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Penelope breaks away from Sinclaire, who continues walking as if she were still holding his arm."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_critical_encounter/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I can't believe I didn't think of it before..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"The man who has confidence in himself gains the confidence of others.\"— Hasidic Proverb."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I've been attracting the worst dates cause I wasn't confident in myself!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And all this time... you were right here telling me to believe in me!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "'Cause you believed in me!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I could have been out here dating hotties and babes left and right..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Instead, I ignored your friendship... and let my self-esteem stay in the toilet."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/48
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Can you ever forgive me... friend?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes... but only if you forgive yourself first."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't even... okay, sure. Alright."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I am not gonna give up! I'm gonna keep getting out there!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But this time... I'm gonna do it with a good friend by my side."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I won't put up with anybody's crap!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "'Cause now I know what real love and support looks like!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But uh, in the meantime..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I can't stop thinking about the fact that I almost dated Sinclaire..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm gonna go cry for a while, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have fun!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lemme know how it goes!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno, that sink-guy was a straight up G."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Aha ha ha ha!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Catch you on the flipside, pal!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Everyone wants to be appreciated, so if you appreciate someone, don’t keep it a secret.\" — Mary Kay Sash"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I've been keeping my appreciation a secret because I was so scared of rejection..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "That's why I've been dating all these weirdos."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But even THOSE guys rejected me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/32
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "So heck, why not!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/40
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "What's one more little rejection?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/48
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I mean it'll just shatter my heart into a million pieces but whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/56
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I APPRECIATE YOU... LIKE, ROMANTICALLY!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... can we just stay friends?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate you too... about time you noticed."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is the greatest day of my life."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh... oh..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "No, I mean, I get it. I understand."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "We did have a good thing going. I mean, we still do."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'd like to stay friends, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Just like, if you hear me crying for the next eight hours... just don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm crying about something else, not you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/58
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But me and you? Pals for life."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-0/66
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm gonna go now..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wait, seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wow, yours too?! What a coincidence!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "WAIT HOLD ON."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You're not rejecting me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I... I made you watch me date all these other objects when you were right there..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You know what, no. You will not ruin this one Penelope."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Um... would you like to... maybe go on a date with me?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if you got another quote!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It's finally happening..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"There are no shortcuts to any place worth going.\"— Beverly Quills."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "It might have taken me a while to get here... but it was all worth it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "There's a quote that really aptly sums up how I feel about you..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/8
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"I FUCKING HATE YOU!\" - ME!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't sound like it came from your calendar."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoah... that's exactly how I feel about you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems a little harsh."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "DID YOU FIGURE THAT OUT ALL BY YOURSELF, SMARTIE?!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "YOU'RE CORRECT! IT CAME FROM MY BRAIN!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
