#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fifth_bulletin/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's been kinda quiet lately..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_fifth_bulletin/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "YOU ARE THIS CLOSE TO THE END... KEEP IT UP!"
