#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_return/0/16
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm still working on myself and you know what they say!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_return/0/24
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"The nice thing about teamwork is that you always have others on your side.\" — Margaret Party"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_friend_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, totally."
