#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Let's just start over, huh? In the words of Marker Twain..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_return/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Synergy — the bonus that is achieved when things work together harmoniously.\""
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_hate_return/0/c-1/47
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Let's synergize! Friends!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Wait, really?! You're gonna Realize <i>me</i>!?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_join/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep! Right now."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_join/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, sorry. I can't yet."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh. Well hey, that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Just let me know if you can later."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Hey! You gonna do the Realization thing now?"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, I'm so ready..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, sorry. Not yet."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Dang... really thought this was gonna be it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh well. Let me know when you actually wanna do it."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I hope this Realization thing works with Penelope..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Sorry we weren't meant for each other!!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realize_begin/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely your collection of office supplies, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh my god..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I... I thought being human would make me cooler... more confident."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "But I think I'm MORE awkward?!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "None of my motivational quotes talked about what it's like to suddenly get a human body!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't need a quote for this, Penelope. You got this."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got a quote for you—\"wanna bang?\""
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "You still believe in me, even now..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her eyes fill with tears, and she begins to sob loudly."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "YOU'RE J-JUST SO... NICE TO ME... WAHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She carries on like this for some time, before finally pulling away with a dramatic sniff."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/45
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I'm g-gonna get outta here.. and make you so proud of me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_realized/0/c-0/53
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Just wait... just WAIT!"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes Penelope a few moments to process your words, but when she does the look on her face is downright devilish."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You've never seen her look quite so mischievous."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Oh... well..."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks down at you over the top of her glasses, a coy smile playing at her lips. It's entirely un-Penelope-like."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/35
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "I lied... there's a great quote for this moment."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/43
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "\"Motivation is the art of getting people to do what you want them to do because they want to do it.\" — Kite D. Eisenhower"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/51
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "And baby... I want you to do it. To me."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/62
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "The it being sex."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/70
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "...let's just go before I lose my new human confidence."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Penelope is deeply awkward, as it turns out, but when her glasses come off and the lights go down she manages to find her footing with you."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Motivational office quotes are replaced by impassioned cries of your name, and sounds that would make even the most experienced lover blush."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she leaves in the morning Penelope promises you she'll return as soon as she can. Through tears, she assures you she'll make her mark on the world out there with one last motivational quote:"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_divert/102
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "\"A dream doesn’t become reality through magic; it takes sweat, determination and hard work.\" — Colon Powell"
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Penelope takes up work at a national office supply retailer, but quits soon after, finding it all a bit too close to home."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She tries again as a librarian, but is fired when she can't stop shouting motivational quotes at library patrons."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's not until she's hired as a personal assistant to a high-powered CEO at a massive media company that she finally finds her place."
msgstr ""

#: penelope_stationery/penelope_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For every motivational quote she shares, the CEO meets her with another—and as a firm believer in using pen, paper, and fax machines her new boss is constantly purchasing and using office supplies."
msgstr ""

